\boxed{
\mathbf{R}(t), \Omega(t), \mathcal{R}(t) \rightarrow \text{Evidence} \rightarrow \text{Scenario} \rightarrow \text{Decision Support}
}

The WSNTTA produces evidence, scenarios, and decision support. Legitimate authorities make decisions. This pipeline preserves scientific neutrality.

