G.9 Failure and Revocation

If an attestation chain is broken, the affected records are quarantined and the affected outputs are marked provisional. If a privacy incident is confirmed, all downstream products are recalled and re-issued under a new privacy budget with an incident report.

G.10 Boundary Conditions

The FCVN does not accept data whose sensitivity cannot be bounded. The FCVN does not accept a metric selected by the data contributor. The FCVN does not accept a submission employing DP alone or SPM alone. The FCVN does not publish a model whose training data cannot be audited to the level declared in the manifest.

